==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage becomes easier to beat quickly with [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter One. With them, the Aliens pose little issue leaving Sunny Celeboodle as the major threat. She's easily outranged and nukable by Bahamut Cat, or you can spam [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cats]] for a faster win.

Additionally, if you have [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], he can block Elizabeth's Wave Attacks making the stage a whole lot easier to beat quickly.

